> REVIEW: Unspecified amount: Salt

== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @sweet potatoes{3/5%lb} (cut into wedges), @olive oil{2/5%tbsp}, @butter{2/5%tbsp} (melted), @maple syrup{3/5%tbsp}, @certified gluten-free miso{2/5%tbsp}, @rice or sherry vinegar{1/5%tbsp}, @orange juice{2/5%tbsp}, @orange zest{1/5%tsp}, @red pepper flakes{1/20%tsp}, @cilantro{1/20%cup} (chopped), @green onions{3/5} (sliced), @sesame seeds{1/5%tbsp} (toasted), @Salt{} (only if needed).

== Preparation ==

Roast sweet potato wedges with olive oil until tender and browned. Mix melted butter, maple syrup, miso, vinegar, orange juice and zest. Coat the cooked wedges and return briefly to the oven to set the glaze. Finish with herbs, green onion, sesame and red pepper.
